{
  "_note": "多城市取数:「我的城市」前 slots 个,**一次多坐标请求**拿全(Open-Meteo 多坐标 → 响应是数组)。\n每城市:现在的 AQI(按当前标准)+ 档位 + 24 小时走势(worse / better / steady)。\n中国标准的走势不需要逐时 AQI:分指数对浓度单调,「24 小时内最高 AQI」= 各项「24 小时最高浓度」的分指数取最大\n(max 与 max 可交换),于是每城市每项只算 3 个分指数(现在 / 24h 峰 / 6h 后峰),不必算 24 × 6 个。\npage=True 是 /city 管理页用的版本:`_cache:1` 只读首页各行已写好的缓存(不打网络),缺几座报 `miss`,\n页面再用 `_cache:0` 真取一次(G23 契约:有缓存先渲,缺的后台补)。页面只要 AQI 与档位色,不算走势。\n由 tools/infosource/gen_air.py 生成。\n⚠️ 这条流**不缓存**(§5.5:组件的 .df 恒不缓存),新鲜度由宿主的 refresh 周期管。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "cities",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "行数守卫:渲染层画几行由它定。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[length::(${saved})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sv",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "aqStd",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bs",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lang",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},en)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1,逐字照抄):地区 cn,或地区未知且界面中文 → 1。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "std",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${sv},cn),cn,if::(eq::(${sv},us),us,if::(eq::(${cnd},1),cn,us)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c3",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},3)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c4",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},4)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c5",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},5)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "屏障:上一步 index:: 落地的对象,紧邻节点读取可能晚一拍。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b2",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm1",
        "value": "${c0.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm2",
        "value": "${c1.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm3",
        "value": "${c2.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm4",
        "value": "${c3.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm5",
        "value": "${c4.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm6",
        "value": "${c5.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "真取数(组件恒走这里)。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(${n},0),1,0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la0",
            "value": "${c0.lat}"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo0",
            "value": "${c0.lon}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "空槽用第一座城市的坐标补齐 —— 请求恒为 6 个坐标,响应恒是数组(单坐标时 Open-Meteo 返回的是对象)。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo1",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo2",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo3",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo4",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "la5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c5.lat},${la0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "lo5",
            "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c5.lon},${lo0})]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "一次请求拿全部城市。`timeformat=unixtime` + 不带 timezone:时间锚按**本机时区**显示\n(几座城市在不同时区,用任一座的当地时间都不对)。⚠️ formatType json 不能漏。",
          "id": "resp",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://air-quality-api.open-meteo.com/v1/air-quality?latitude=${la0},${la1},${la2},${la3},${la4},${la5}&longitude=${lo0},${lo1},${lo2},${lo3},${lo4},${lo5}&current=us_aqi,pm2_5,pm10,ozone,nitrogen_dioxide,sulphur_dioxide,carbon_monoxide&hourly=us_aqi,pm2_5,pm10,ozone,nitrogen_dioxide,sulphur_dioxide,carbon_monoxide&forecast_hours=24&timeformat=unixtime",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "屏障(勿删):request / data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果(晚一拍),隔一个空 set 再用。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x0",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},0)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x1",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},1)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x2",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},2)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x3",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},3)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x4",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},4)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "x5",
            "value": "$[index::(${resp},5)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "屏障:index:: 落地的对象,紧邻节点读取可能晚一拍。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_bx",
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "错误出口:第一座城市连时次都没有 = 这次没拿到(网络 / 接口)→ 抛错,平台回落上次成功的数据。\n⚠️ 时次是 unixtime 数字,不能用 length::(对数字恒返 0),用哨兵串判。",
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${x0.current.time},__none__),__none__),1,0)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "error",
              "params": {
                "errorMsg": "air_unreachable"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "at",
            "value": "$[formatDate::(calc::(${x0.current.time}*1000),HH:mm)]"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "美国标准:接口直接给 US AQI(现在 + 逐时)。",
